Thrown in a medium arc, the grenade explodes once its speed has decreased sufficiently. A brief delay prevents it from exploding immediately.

The explosion deals up to <pve 814 /> <pvp [130] /> damage and applies 60 stacks of <solar Scorch /> in an 8 meter radius. Damage is increased by 31.5% to <pve 1,202 /> <pvp [173] /> against enemies within 1 meter of the grenade.

// The source's stated 31.5% increase does not match both listed damage values. All values are retained pending verification. Source lists Scorch as x60+30; the enhancement granting the additional 30 stacks is not identified.
